  "question_stem": "The daily rainfall, $x$ mm, in a certain village is recorded on 250 consecutive days. The results are summarised in the following cumulative frequency table.\n\n| Rainfall, $x$ mm | $x \\leqslant 20$ | $x \\leqslant 30$ | $x \\leqslant 40$ | $x \\leqslant 50$ | $x \\leqslant 70$ | $x \\leqslant 100$ |\n| Cumulative frequency | 52 | 94 | 142 | 172 | 222 | 250 |",
  "context_texts": [
    "Cumulative-frequency graph through $(0,0),(20,52),(30,94),(40,142),(50,172),(70,222),(100,250)$, with appropriate axes and scales."
